{"4137010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Courting of Curses", "steam_appid": 4137010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become</strong> <strong>the villainess of someone else's story. </strong>Find romance with a forgotten fiend, a &quot;loyal&quot; knight, the <i>perfect</i> rival, or your cruelly cursed betrothed. Survive a school season towards the edge of winter, in a mysterious, magical academy. And every morning, evening, and night: <strong>study, socialise, or fight</strong> - and then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide what you will do:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/df74b7270ffca4b9192466b474019bd1.avif?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Break your destiny and find : Revenge, ruin, or redemption\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/df74b7270ffca4b9192466b474019bd1.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/d61e4fab38e561f7496678cbedfd9721.webp?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Create your own villainess\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/d61e4fab38e561f7496678cbedfd9721.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your personality and future with deep, immersive choices at every step, from your tone to terrible consequences. Charm or scandalise the manor with your choice of flowing dresses. Choose your colouring—hair, skin, and eyes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/80a1b2f59eb5b618cbf1947b59214c61.poster.avif?t=1785576055\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/80a1b2f59eb5b618cbf1947b59214c61.webm?t=1785576055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/80a1b2f59eb5b618cbf1947b59214c61.mp4?t=1785576055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— &quot;Hair as red as blood, fair as gold, or dark as night?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/e3ec7a4a1d88c735fd2d2ed51428d1ea.webp?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Study your way to power:\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/e3ec7a4a1d88c735fd2d2ed51428d1ea.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your magic and knowledge to thrive in this new and unfamiliar world. Devour books from even the most forbidden stacks, and craft your weekly assignment with every action you take. Be rewarded for good grades or die by a fail—ask a friend for an essay critique or aim to beat their marks<i> by any trickery you may manage...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/a2fe9d7dc596ae52d29a61283273d859.avif?t=1785576055\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Develop your mind, your reputation, and your magic  of the six elements.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/b72e42c5f72a9d5036b2b910cefa9ca7.webp?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Socialise your way to safety:\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/b72e42c5f72a9d5036b2b910cefa9ca7.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form complex relationships: friendly, antagonistic, romantic, transactional—or all at the same time! Romance contrasting men, a complex woman, and the very manifestation of mystery. Love or power? Freedom or fate? Survive the love affairs of a dark fairy tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/d8bab95e48cfcc1cebac4ee1dd38c470.avif?t=1785576055\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/d8bab95e48cfcc1cebac4ee1dd38c470.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Four <u>deep</u> romances, with varied characters and dynamics.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/04cb4f2d62606deb593ea14304bc7809.webp?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Fight your way to freedom:\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/04cb4f2d62606deb593ea14304bc7809.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the dark forest, battling monsters with magic to deepen your knowledge of the tainted, demonic beasts. <i>Or</i> let your new companions do such rough tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/29bb19ce823adfb0ec915e919c646413.avif?t=1785576055\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=749 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Real-time, 3D third-person magical combat!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/96d99a9aa7662c8b18575f352b6354e0.webp?t=1785576055\" alt=\"Explore an intimate, eerie setting:\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras_big/96d99a9aa7662c8b18575f352b6354e0.webp?t=1785576055 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live and die in a dark academia location, set in a historical, magical world filled with characters full of gothic romance twists and turns. Search the ever-mystifying academy and the forests on its borders and the dungeons below for your salvation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137010/extras/6e021fce529d7705ff6338ca7bcaab8d.avif?t=1785576055\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Find secrets, dangers, and deep powers in a world filled with its own forgotten history.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please <strong><u>Wishlist</u></strong> our: FMC, romantasy, story-focused RPG set in an immersive, mystical world!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 3D Third-Person school sim-RPG </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Romance Options (men and woman*) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩🏽 Customizable villainess FMC protag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👗 Dress Up (with Flowing Dresses!) </p>